      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-12T04:02:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Things beneath things are still Environment, Hero or Vilain cards (and come from the same deck, e.g. it's Tempest's hero card), they just don't have any text or 'sub-types' (e.g. Ongoing or Target) on them. Anything that triggers off of 'card type' destructions triggers, anything that triggers off of 'card sub-type' destruction does not.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
